WEBVTT

00:21.896 --> 00:24.149
Yeah, I'm on my way now.

00:24.232 --> 00:27.027
We still don't know the full details,

00:27.110 --> 00:31.948
but there's only one guard on the job,
two at most, so it'll be easy.

00:32.449 --> 00:33.742
You sure about that?

00:33.825 --> 00:36.036
Yeah, I might've just picked this info up...

00:36.119 --> 00:37.579
but it checks out.

00:38.455 --> 00:39.789
Got it.

00:39.873 --> 00:41.833
Contact the Disposal Unit.

00:41.916 --> 00:43.084
Roger that!

00:53.553 --> 00:54.929
I looked over the books...

00:55.013 --> 00:57.807
and there ain't no way
we can squeeze any money outta them.

00:57.891 --> 01:01.478
Well, if we don't figure something out,
the boss is gonna beat the shit out of us.

01:02.062 --> 01:03.605
- Huh?
- Who're you?

01:13.740 --> 01:15.784
Who the hell are you, asshole?

01:19.079 --> 01:19.954
Hey, old man!

01:20.663 --> 01:22.916
I said, "Who the hell are you?"

01:24.042 --> 01:24.918
Got a light?

01:25.543 --> 01:27.295
No, I ain't got a goddamn light!

01:29.798 --> 01:30.632
I see.

01:42.185 --> 01:43.728
What the hell is he after?

01:43.812 --> 01:45.688
It's obvious, right?

01:45.772 --> 01:46.648
What?

01:46.731 --> 01:48.316
The extermination of irredeemables.

01:48.399 --> 01:49.275
Dammit!

02:04.874 --> 02:06.084
Shit!

02:08.211 --> 02:09.129
Why him?

02:09.712 --> 02:13.633
The hitman who'll kill anyone
if the money's right!

02:15.969 --> 02:17.262
"If the money's right"?

02:17.929 --> 02:19.806
That's news to me.

02:19.889 --> 02:22.809
I make it a rule
to only kill irredeemables.

02:23.518 --> 02:24.477
Huh?

02:25.395 --> 02:26.729
I'm sorry.

02:26.813 --> 02:28.148
Please just spare my life.

02:28.731 --> 02:30.024
Die!

02:53.131 --> 02:55.550
Damn, 25 guys, huh?

02:56.134 --> 02:57.760
Impressive as always!

02:57.844 --> 02:59.429
- Kotatsu Nekota...
- Yeah?

02:59.512 --> 03:03.391
If I recall, you told me
there was one guard, two at most, right?

03:06.603 --> 03:08.146
M-My bad!

03:08.229 --> 03:11.107
But still, you managed
to take them all out anyway!

03:11.190 --> 03:13.526
As you'd expect of the legendary hitman!

03:14.152 --> 03:16.988
Say that again,
and our partnership is over.

03:17.071 --> 03:18.406
I'll watch my mouth!

03:20.533 --> 03:22.493
Not much in here, huh?

03:24.370 --> 03:26.205
A wasp nest?

03:26.706 --> 03:27.540
Hey, Boss...

03:28.124 --> 03:30.335
wouldja mind giving me a ride back?

03:30.418 --> 03:31.336
I don't mind.

03:32.170 --> 03:34.172
While we're at it,
wanna grab something to eat?

03:34.255 --> 03:35.173
Sounds good!

03:35.256 --> 03:36.382
OPEN

03:36.466 --> 03:37.759
Here you go.

03:48.311 --> 03:49.812
Can't take hot food.

03:50.396 --> 03:52.607
Damn, this is good!

03:53.274 --> 03:55.818
How much garlic are you putting in there?

03:55.902 --> 03:59.364
It's fine. Ain't anybody here
I need to mind my manners around.

04:05.578 --> 04:07.205
Okay, I'm heading in!

04:07.288 --> 04:08.498
Yeah.

04:15.255 --> 04:16.089
I'm sorry!

04:19.384 --> 04:20.260
You're fine.

04:22.136 --> 04:24.055
I-I'm sorry!

04:24.138 --> 04:25.682
I'm sorry!

04:25.765 --> 04:28.434
I've never been good with kids.

04:30.645 --> 04:33.064
I never know
how I'm supposed to talk to them.

04:34.983 --> 04:38.403
If I'd been a little better
at that sort of thing, maybe...

04:40.280 --> 04:41.739
Maybe now...

04:42.365 --> 04:43.992
things would be...

04:47.704 --> 04:49.789
What should I have done?

04:50.581 --> 04:52.333
I still don't know.

04:53.209 --> 04:55.837
Hell, I don't even know
what I should've said.

04:58.298 --> 05:01.467
We don't even have anything in common.
No shared interests, nothing.

05:01.551 --> 05:03.594
-Work is all I've got.
- Papa!

05:03.678 --> 05:05.847
And I only do it 'cause I'm good.
It's not like I love my job.

05:06.806 --> 05:10.101
What a boring life I've had.

05:11.936 --> 05:12.812
Boss!

05:13.396 --> 05:14.897
I'll leave the key here!

05:14.981 --> 05:15.898
Okay.

05:16.899 --> 05:18.818
Hey, I'm gonna use your bathroom!

05:18.901 --> 05:21.404
Then do me a favor and clean it
while you're in there.

05:24.991 --> 05:25.908
Ow!

05:28.578 --> 05:29.620
A wasp?

05:29.704 --> 05:30.621
Shit!

05:30.705 --> 05:32.832
I've never seen one like this before!

05:46.345 --> 05:47.263
Boss!

05:47.930 --> 05:49.098
Stay with me!

05:52.351 --> 05:53.644
Kozue...

06:00.276 --> 06:02.820
Nope, I've got no idea!

06:04.030 --> 06:05.031
Where am I?

06:05.114 --> 06:06.324
Oh, you're awake?

06:06.407 --> 06:07.241
Eri...

06:07.825 --> 06:08.701
Then this is...

06:09.202 --> 06:11.204
Yep. My lab.

06:11.788 --> 06:13.915
Sorry to hit you with this
the second you wake up,

06:13.998 --> 06:16.584
but could you answer
a few quick questions?

06:16.667 --> 06:17.710
Yeah.

06:18.211 --> 06:20.546
Your full name and affiliation?

06:21.047 --> 06:22.757
Juzo Ogami.

06:22.840 --> 06:25.343
Z.O.O. Assassin Syndicate.

06:25.426 --> 06:26.344
And me?

06:26.427 --> 06:27.970
Eri Wanibuchi.

06:28.054 --> 06:30.890
Chief of Z.O.O.'s science division and my...

06:31.557 --> 06:32.725
ex-wife.

06:32.809 --> 06:34.936
Well, your memory seems fine.

06:35.728 --> 06:37.563
Your vitals were stable,

06:37.647 --> 06:40.024
but when they brought you in,
you already looked like that.

06:40.108 --> 06:42.235
So, yeah, I was worried.

06:42.819 --> 06:45.071
It looks like the cause was wasp venom.

06:45.154 --> 06:46.739
A wasp?

06:46.823 --> 06:48.699
Oh, right, there was a nest.

06:49.909 --> 06:50.785
Hmm?

06:50.868 --> 06:52.328
I only figured it out afterward...

06:53.079 --> 06:55.289
but the company
your target was dealing with

06:55.373 --> 06:59.168
was a firm that also researches
genetic manipulation in living organisms.

06:59.252 --> 07:02.213
In other words, that was no ordinary wasp.

07:03.297 --> 07:05.299
What the hell? Who is that?

07:05.383 --> 07:07.176
Wait, me?

07:07.260 --> 07:09.053
I mean, me as a kid?

07:09.887 --> 07:11.055
I'll change back, right?

07:11.139 --> 07:12.598
Tell me I can change back!

07:13.266 --> 07:14.225
No clue.

07:14.809 --> 07:15.977
Come on!

07:16.060 --> 07:18.020
You're the organization's
resident genius, Eri!

07:18.104 --> 07:22.024
Yeah, but this isn't exactly something
you can analyze that easily.

07:23.109 --> 07:24.068
More importantly...

07:25.319 --> 07:26.320
my voice is so high!

07:26.988 --> 07:29.115
And my skin's all smooth, too.

07:29.198 --> 07:30.283
Good for you.

07:34.036 --> 07:35.371
Good for you?

07:35.455 --> 07:36.289
The hell it is!

07:36.372 --> 07:39.041
Well, for now, all we can do
is keep an eye on it.

07:39.709 --> 07:42.086
Looks like you've got no choice
but to take a break from work.

07:42.170 --> 07:43.004
What?

07:43.087 --> 07:44.088
That's a problem!

07:44.172 --> 07:46.632
I've got a mortgage, a car payment
and child support, too!

07:46.716 --> 07:48.593
Well, I have a job, so I'm good on my end.

07:48.676 --> 07:49.510
Heartless!

07:49.594 --> 07:52.305
So, anyway,
when I told the boss about it--

07:52.388 --> 07:53.806
Oh, speak of the devil.

07:56.809 --> 07:57.643
Yeah?

07:57.727 --> 08:00.104
Oh, is that really you, Juzo?

08:00.605 --> 08:03.900
Yeah. The voice is higher, but it's me.

08:03.983 --> 08:04.942
Yeah.

08:05.026 --> 08:08.070
Sounds like things
have gotten pretty strange.

08:08.905 --> 08:10.364
I'm fine, though.

08:10.448 --> 08:12.533
I can still do the job
even looking like this.

08:12.617 --> 08:13.618
Sign me up.

08:14.202 --> 08:16.871
I figured you'd say that.

08:16.954 --> 08:20.249
As it happens,
I've got the perfect assignment for you.

08:20.833 --> 08:22.460
I need you to attend middle school.

08:24.462 --> 08:25.296
Huh?

08:25.379 --> 08:26.172
Actually...

08:27.006 --> 08:31.761
I'm thinking of enrolling my daughter in
a certain private middle school next year.

08:31.844 --> 08:34.931
I want you to slip in there
and investigate the place from the inside.

08:35.014 --> 08:37.266
Hey! What is this, doting-dad nonsense?

08:37.350 --> 08:39.185
Don't dress it up like a real assignment!

08:39.268 --> 08:40.353
All you really mean is

08:40.436 --> 08:43.439
"I wanna know what kind of school
my daughter's gonna be going to," right?

08:43.523 --> 08:45.441
Sounds fine to me.

08:45.525 --> 08:47.944
You only made it through
elementary school anyway, didn't you?

08:48.027 --> 08:50.530
Yeah, but that doesn't mean
I wanna go back now!

08:51.822 --> 08:54.116
Maybe I am a doting father.

08:54.200 --> 08:55.743
Don't try to make it sound cool!

08:56.285 --> 08:57.620
But it is a job.

08:58.246 --> 08:59.413
I'll pay you.

09:02.333 --> 09:06.254
SATURDAY, APRIL 11TH

09:11.551 --> 09:12.468
Oh!

09:12.552 --> 09:14.512
I like the look!

09:14.595 --> 09:16.806
I feel like I'm cosplaying or something.

09:17.598 --> 09:19.058
What's with the glasses?

09:19.141 --> 09:21.269
They've got an earpiece
and a camera built in!

09:21.352 --> 09:24.564
Seeing as you're a washed-up
old man on the inside,

09:24.647 --> 09:26.566
I'll be backing you up for now!

09:26.649 --> 09:30.611
You're not wrong, but you're saying it
way too bluntly, Zoomer.

09:32.780 --> 09:34.365
This is a disaster.

09:34.448 --> 09:37.326
I'm bad with kids, so why the hell
am I going to middle school?

09:38.744 --> 09:40.371
But it's for the money.

09:40.454 --> 09:42.415
Beggars can't be choosers.

09:42.999 --> 09:48.087
Well then, congratulations
on your admission to Rikka Middle School!

09:48.170 --> 09:49.088
At our school...

09:49.880 --> 09:52.967
So, I want to join
the basketball team and do my best.

09:53.050 --> 09:54.260
Nice to meet you!

09:55.553 --> 09:57.346
Isn't he kinda cute?

09:57.430 --> 09:58.681
Totally!

09:58.764 --> 09:59.890
Okay, next.

10:01.559 --> 10:03.144
Uh...

10:03.853 --> 10:06.230
I'm Juzo Ogami.

10:07.106 --> 10:08.190
Nice to meet you.

10:11.027 --> 10:11.944
That's all.

10:13.279 --> 10:14.155
Huh?

10:16.657 --> 10:17.491
Pass.

10:17.575 --> 10:18.743
He's gloomy as hell.

10:18.826 --> 10:20.703
That intro sucked, Boss!

10:20.786 --> 10:21.954
Y-You little...

10:22.038 --> 10:24.415
Blending in with the class
is part of the job, too!

10:25.875 --> 10:29.003
Uh, actually,
I guess I'll say a little more.

10:29.754 --> 10:31.005
Hobbies...

10:31.672 --> 10:32.882
None.

10:32.965 --> 10:34.425
Special skill...

10:36.010 --> 10:36.969
Sniping?

10:37.053 --> 10:38.638
SELF-INTRODUCTION

10:42.099 --> 10:42.975
Guns?

10:43.059 --> 10:45.311
Huh? Is he at war or something?

10:46.771 --> 10:48.648
That's a garbage answer, Boss!

10:48.731 --> 10:50.149
No! Airsoft!

10:50.232 --> 10:51.359
Fake guns, obviously!

10:51.442 --> 10:54.028
Yeah, I'm into survival games!

10:54.111 --> 10:54.945
Oh...

10:55.029 --> 10:56.072
That kind of kid.

10:57.073 --> 10:59.200
Either way, he's definitely a loser.

10:59.825 --> 11:01.410
Yeah, he seems super gloomy.

11:01.494 --> 11:02.703
Okay, next.

11:07.291 --> 11:09.126
That's finally over.

11:10.419 --> 11:13.506
If day one's already like this,
I'm not looking forward to what's ahead.

11:13.589 --> 11:15.341
...and then he actually talked back.

11:16.258 --> 11:18.928
Oh, sorry, otaku boy.

11:19.845 --> 11:21.680
C'mon!

11:21.764 --> 11:23.516
He'll snipe you.

11:23.599 --> 11:24.683
I'm so scared!

11:24.767 --> 11:26.644
Want me to take them out, Boss?

11:26.727 --> 11:28.187
No, leave it.

11:29.688 --> 11:31.190
Sorry to keep you waiting!

11:32.566 --> 11:34.193
Omurice is served!

11:34.819 --> 11:36.112
Dig in!

11:37.363 --> 11:41.242
Why the hell are you cooking at my place?

11:42.701 --> 11:43.744
Hey, this is good!

11:44.245 --> 11:45.079
If I didn't,

11:45.162 --> 11:47.790
you'd chow down on a giant bowl
of garlic-loaded ramen, right?

11:47.873 --> 11:51.919
A middle schooler who reeks of garlic
is gonna get ostracized in no time.

11:53.129 --> 11:56.841
That self-intro was seriously
so god-awful, even I was put off!

11:57.425 --> 12:00.010
Obviously, you need to keep
your identity hidden,

12:00.094 --> 12:02.555
but also make sure
you do not get into any trouble

12:02.638 --> 12:04.807
that could get you suspended or expelled!

12:05.349 --> 12:09.186
Bottom line, if you can't keep going
to school, your income drops to zero!

12:10.396 --> 12:11.939
You get ready for tomorrow yet?

12:12.022 --> 12:13.149
What are you, my mom?

12:13.232 --> 12:16.944
What exactly am I supposed to be
getting ready for besides the assignment?

12:17.027 --> 12:20.239
Uh, school is supposed to be
a place where you go to study.

12:21.657 --> 12:23.659
We'll be starting lessons today.

12:24.243 --> 12:27.496
If there's anything you don't understand,
raise your hand.

12:27.580 --> 12:29.540
All right, open your textbooks.

12:30.040 --> 12:31.625
Study, huh?

12:33.836 --> 12:34.879
When I was a kid...

12:35.588 --> 12:37.756
I got taken in by the organization
and put through training.

12:39.842 --> 12:41.635
I got thrown straight into the field.

12:43.471 --> 12:46.432
Even so, I've still managed
to make it this far.

12:47.099 --> 12:49.602
I'm 39. I've been through it all...

12:49.685 --> 12:53.272
been married,
and I've even got a daughter.

12:53.814 --> 12:56.525
At this point in my life,
studying is just...

12:58.027 --> 12:59.570
First, positive numbers.

12:59.653 --> 13:04.700
The one, two, three and so on
that you've been using in everyday life.

13:05.284 --> 13:07.077
And now, a new concept.

13:19.507 --> 13:21.050
Numbers...

13:21.717 --> 13:24.053
I always thought they just kept going up.

13:25.721 --> 13:28.474
There's a whole world
of negative numbers, too?

13:30.309 --> 13:32.436
That's incredible!

13:54.458 --> 13:56.585
All right, that's it for today.

13:56.669 --> 14:00.339
Make sure you review the material
and don't forget your homework.

14:00.422 --> 14:03.926
HOW TO USE A MICROSCOPE

14:06.262 --> 14:07.763
This is fun!

14:08.264 --> 14:09.682
Studying!

14:09.765 --> 14:13.227
Math, science, social studies,
language arts, all of it!

14:13.769 --> 14:15.771
Learning things I never knew before...

14:16.522 --> 14:18.357
understanding them on a deeper level!

14:18.440 --> 14:19.441
GOD OF STUDY

14:19.525 --> 14:22.069
I can't help feeling excited!

14:23.153 --> 14:25.489
Have I spent all this time
deliberately trying not to think,

14:25.573 --> 14:27.658
just keeping my head down
and doing the job?

14:27.741 --> 14:29.076
Is this the backlash from that?

14:29.994 --> 14:32.121
Every little thing I'm being taught

14:32.788 --> 14:37.084
is hitting me harder than even a glass
of whiskey after a job well done!

14:39.253 --> 14:40.087
Boss!

14:40.170 --> 14:41.297
Dinner's read--

14:41.964 --> 14:43.924
W-What's wrong?

14:46.176 --> 14:48.762
This has turned into a serious problem.

14:49.430 --> 14:50.389
Huh?

14:50.931 --> 14:52.766
Middle school coursework...

14:53.309 --> 14:55.394
is so damn fun, I can't stand it!

14:56.312 --> 14:59.648
I have no idea
why that's supposed to be a problem.

15:00.232 --> 15:03.360
I finished my review
and homework in no time.

15:03.861 --> 15:06.780
And then I went ahead
and did tomorrow's prep, too!

15:07.364 --> 15:10.409
Wow, those classes
really got their hooks in you.

15:10.492 --> 15:11.577
What's for dinner?

15:11.660 --> 15:12.912
Mackerel in miso.

15:12.995 --> 15:15.915
DHA's supposed to be good for studying.

15:15.998 --> 15:18.751
You're careless with the details at work,

15:18.834 --> 15:20.920
but you're surprisingly
meticulous at cooking.

15:36.518 --> 15:38.103
See you later!

15:41.273 --> 15:42.441
What should I do?

15:43.317 --> 15:45.819
Today was a blast, too!

15:45.903 --> 15:47.321
Social studies especially.

15:47.404 --> 15:48.280
It was like,

15:48.364 --> 15:51.533
"Oh, so that's what that was. I've seen
places like that on the job before."

15:51.617 --> 15:55.371
When it connects to your own
life experience, it makes it even better!

15:57.247 --> 15:59.959
Boss, you should probably head home soon.

16:01.835 --> 16:03.504
Still...

16:04.588 --> 16:07.132
I'm not good with kids.

16:07.216 --> 16:09.593
I wanna get back to my old body already.

16:10.260 --> 16:12.846
-Is it me, or is it noisy over there?
- Huh?

16:12.930 --> 16:14.598
Everyone, get back
inside the building immediately!

16:14.682 --> 16:16.266
Oh, right.

16:19.269 --> 16:21.397
PANDA MASK

16:23.691 --> 16:25.693
Seriously?
He took him down with one flying kick?

16:26.276 --> 16:27.111
Who is that guy?

16:27.194 --> 16:29.321
How's he so crazy athletic?

16:30.406 --> 16:32.116
- This is hilarious!
- Uh, wait.

16:32.783 --> 16:34.702
He's coming this way.

16:37.329 --> 16:39.623
- He's coming right at us!
- No way!

16:44.920 --> 16:46.672
Okay, I've decided.

16:47.589 --> 16:49.341
Behold all that I am!

16:50.342 --> 16:51.969
S-Screw you!

16:52.052 --> 16:53.804
Go get arrested already!

16:55.681 --> 16:56.807
Don't worry!

16:57.307 --> 16:58.726
I'm confident I can get away.

16:58.809 --> 17:01.729
Even if I do get caught,
I'm prepared for that!

17:01.812 --> 17:04.857
Even if it all ends here, that's fine.

17:05.607 --> 17:08.068
I'll give you everything I've got.

17:08.152 --> 17:10.112
- Gross!
- What the hell is with that guy?

17:10.195 --> 17:12.531
- You disgusting pervert panda freak!
- Springtime, huh?

17:12.614 --> 17:16.201
Aren't those the two girls
who copped that attitude with you?

17:16.285 --> 17:17.911
You don't owe them any help.

17:17.995 --> 17:21.081
Why not just leave 'em?
It's not like they're gonna die.

17:21.165 --> 17:23.584
Yeah, true.

17:26.253 --> 17:30.215
But still, those two
are about the same age as my daughter.

17:30.299 --> 17:31.175
Huh?

17:31.258 --> 17:34.178
I'm a grown-ass man.

17:34.261 --> 17:35.137
JAPANESE LITERATURE

17:35.220 --> 17:39.183
As far as I'm concerned, whether
I help somebody because I owe them one

17:39.266 --> 17:42.186
or don't because I don't,
that kind of petty crap doesn't matter.

17:42.811 --> 17:45.689
W-Wait, you absolutely
can't blow your cover!

17:45.773 --> 17:46.774
Yeah, I know.

17:48.734 --> 17:49.568
Huh?

17:55.324 --> 17:57.493
I see! A smokescreen with chalk!

17:57.576 --> 17:59.244
And damn, that quick draw is insane!

17:59.828 --> 18:01.955
Would you mind shutting up for a second?

18:04.041 --> 18:05.584
Who's there?

18:08.378 --> 18:09.379
Huh?

18:09.463 --> 18:11.507
I meant to drop him with one punch.

18:12.925 --> 18:15.636
This guy's not actually strong, but...

18:15.719 --> 18:17.971
Oh, right.
It's because I turned into a kid.

18:18.055 --> 18:20.432
W-Who are you?

18:21.100 --> 18:22.684
If that's how it's gonna be...

18:25.229 --> 18:28.398
then we're all going out
with a bang together!

18:28.482 --> 18:30.567
Wait, where the hell
did you even pull that out of?

18:35.155 --> 18:37.783
This is way past playing with fire.

18:38.367 --> 18:40.786
If you pull something like that again,
I'll take your head.

18:42.162 --> 18:43.705
Not that one.

18:51.880 --> 18:52.673
Huh?

18:52.756 --> 18:54.925
Wait, the one who saved us...

18:55.008 --> 18:55.801
Ota...

18:56.718 --> 18:58.428
Ogami?

18:58.512 --> 18:59.388
Huh?

18:59.930 --> 19:02.099
N-Nope.

19:02.182 --> 19:05.477
Some total stranger just happened
to pass by and beat him up.

19:05.561 --> 19:09.523
I'm just an ordinary
first-year middle school student

19:09.606 --> 19:11.984
who comes to school
to study like a normal kid!

19:12.067 --> 19:13.318
- Huh?
- Huh?

19:14.653 --> 19:15.737
So, yeah!

19:16.280 --> 19:17.114
I'm off!

19:17.698 --> 19:19.116
See you tomorrow!

19:19.700 --> 19:20.659
Huh?

19:20.742 --> 19:21.785
Why's he collapsed?

19:21.869 --> 19:23.328
- Did he blow himself up?
- Hey!

19:23.412 --> 19:24.371
Stand back!

19:25.706 --> 19:28.375
The explosive device
was homemade by the suspect...

19:28.458 --> 19:32.129
and the identity of the person
who rescued the students remains unknown.

19:32.212 --> 19:33.589
Yikes!

19:33.672 --> 19:35.465
So, stuff like this really happens, huh?

19:35.549 --> 19:36.592
I guess so.

19:36.675 --> 19:39.511
Police are also investigating whether
he may be connected to other crimes.

19:40.262 --> 19:42.639
Hey, after this, let's all go hang out!

19:42.723 --> 19:44.057
I'm in!

19:44.141 --> 19:45.434
Me, too!

19:45.517 --> 19:47.686
Why don't we just make
a class group chat while we're at it?

19:47.769 --> 19:48.812
Sounds good!

19:48.896 --> 19:50.063
I'm in, too.

19:50.147 --> 19:51.398
Send me your handle.

19:51.481 --> 19:53.066
That just leaves...

19:53.692 --> 19:54.526
Oh.

19:54.610 --> 19:55.903
Him?

19:56.445 --> 19:57.738
It's probably fine.

19:57.821 --> 19:59.990
He doesn't seem like the type
who'd be into that stuff anyway.

20:00.073 --> 20:01.533
By all means, ignore me.

20:01.617 --> 20:04.494
- Honestly, that works for me, too.
- No, let's just ask him.

20:04.578 --> 20:07.956
Yeah, we can't just decide on our own
to leave him out, right?

20:08.040 --> 20:09.166
- Huh?
- Exactly.

20:10.626 --> 20:12.669
No, I mean, I'm totally fine with it.

20:12.753 --> 20:14.713
They made a class group chat.

20:14.796 --> 20:15.672
Wanna join?

20:16.256 --> 20:17.174
And, uh...

20:17.257 --> 20:18.717
I think, probably...

20:19.259 --> 20:22.054
thanks for the other day.

20:22.137 --> 20:23.138
Thanks.

20:23.889 --> 20:27.017
I really don't care
about the group chat thing, though.

20:29.436 --> 20:30.604
Well...

20:30.687 --> 20:31.605
whatever.

20:37.861 --> 20:39.029
Just now...

20:40.822 --> 20:43.242
What is with this insanely fast pace?

20:43.325 --> 20:44.910
There's no way I can keep up,

20:44.993 --> 20:46.912
and the notifications just keep coming!

20:46.995 --> 20:48.205
How do I make it stop?

20:48.288 --> 20:49.331
Okay, I'm sorry already!

20:49.414 --> 20:50.415
Please have mercy!

20:51.250 --> 20:52.501
This is hopeless.

20:52.584 --> 20:54.544
Middle school is brutal.

20:55.087 --> 20:58.465
Well, old guys do type pretty slow.

21:03.011 --> 21:04.054
Want a cigarette?

21:04.554 --> 21:05.597
I quit.

21:06.098 --> 21:08.016
Besides, ever since ending up
in this body,

21:08.100 --> 21:10.102
I can't handle booze
or cigarettes anymore.

21:14.815 --> 21:16.108
But still...

21:16.191 --> 21:21.238
I feel way better than I ever did
after finishing one of my old jobs.

21:22.322 --> 21:23.615
For now, I guess...

21:23.699 --> 21:26.118
I'll keep at it a little longer.

21:27.619 --> 21:28.787
All right.

21:28.870 --> 21:30.455
Time to do my homework.

23:03.256 --> 23:04.674
What is it, Eri?

23:04.758 --> 23:07.427
It's about that wasp that stung you.

23:07.511 --> 23:10.430
The thing doesn't exist in nature.

23:10.514 --> 23:12.641
It was an artificially created wasp.

23:13.308 --> 23:15.727
And the company that made it
was Mitsuoka Pharmaceuticals.

23:15.811 --> 23:17.979
It's grown rapidly over the last ten years

23:18.063 --> 23:20.857
and is now the second-largest
company in the country.

23:20.941 --> 23:22.234
And get this.

23:22.317 --> 23:23.777
Believe it or not,

23:23.860 --> 23:26.446
the daughter of its president
is in your class.

23:27.364 --> 23:29.658
If you can make contact with her,

23:29.741 --> 23:32.327
you might be able to gain
some useful information.

23:32.953 --> 23:34.663
Her name is...

23:35.247 --> 23:36.998
Noren Mitsuoka.

23:37.749 --> 23:38.792
Mornin'.

23:38.875 --> 23:40.043
Morning!
